# Stack

- **Desktop:** Tauri 2 + Rust (`src-tauri/`)
- **UI:** React + TypeScript + Vite + Monaco (`src/`)
- **Not** Next.js — static `dist/` can be hosted as a browser demo; native FS needs Tauri

## Conventions

- Keep chrome tokens in CSS / theme packages (`npp-x.theme/1`); don’t sprinkle raw hex in components when a token exists
- Design system source: `design-system/npp-x/MASTER.md` (+ page overrides)
- Brand voice: `docs/brand-guidelines.md`
- Plugins/themes: schemas in CONTRIBUTING.md; examples under `community/examples/`
